{"id": "381388", "name": "כלל השרשרת – נגזרת של הרכבה לפי ערכי f, g ונגזרותיהן ב-0", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונות שתי פונקציות גזירות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f,g:R \\rightarrow R\\)</span> שמקיימות את התנאים הבאים:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f(0)=\\pi, \\quad f'(0)={{CT:0}}, \\quad g(0)={{CT:1}}, \\quad g'(0)={{CT:2}} \\]</p><p>חשבו את הנגזרת של שתי הפונקציות הבאות באפס (רשמו ערכים מדויקים):</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ h(x)= \\sin \\left(f(x)\\right), \\qquad k(x)=\\sin \\left(f(x) \\cdot g(x) \\right) \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>הנגזרת של הפונקציה הראשונה היא:</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(h'(0)=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p>והנגזרת של הפונקציה השניה היא:</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(k'(0)=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> גוזרים כל פונקציה לפי כלל השרשרת ומציבים את הנתונים באפס. ב-k הפונקציה הפנימית היא מכפלה, ולכן נדרש גם כלל המכפלה.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הנגזרת של h</b><br><p>לפי כלל השרשרת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(h'(x)=\\cos\\left(f(x)\\right)\\cdot f'(x)\\)</span>. מציבים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x=0\\)</span>:</p><div style=\"background:#FFF8E6;border:1px solid #E8D29A;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:12px 0\">כלל השרשרת: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\frac{d}{dx}f(g(x))=f'(g(x))\\,g'(x) \\)</span></div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ h'(0)=\\cos(\\pi)\\cdot\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)=-1\\cdot\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)={{CT:3}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — הנגזרת של k</b><br><p>כאן הפונקציה הפנימית היא המכפלה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(x)g(x)\\)</span>, ולכן לפי כלל השרשרת וכלל המכפלה:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ k'(x)=\\cos\\left(f(x)g(x)\\right)\\cdot\\left(f'(x)g(x)+f(x)g'(x)\\right) \\]</p><p>בנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x=0\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f(0)g(0)={{CT:4}},\\qquad \\cos\\left({{CT:4}}\\right)={{CT:5}} \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f'(0)g(0)+f(0)g'(0)={{CT:0}}\\cdot\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)+\\pi\\cdot\\left({{CT:2}}\\right)={{CT:6}} \\]</p><p>ולכן</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ h'(0)={{CT:3}},\\qquad k'(0)={{CT:5}}\\cdot\\left({{CT:6}}\\right)={{CT:7}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]]", "prtcorrect": "<p>Correct answer, well done.</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p>Your answer is partially correct.</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p>Incorrect answer.</p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "tans1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "a", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<p>שימו לב: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(h'(0)=\\cos\\left(f(0)\\right)\\cdot f'(0)\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\cos(\\pi)=-1\\)</span>.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<p>הנגזרת של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\sin\\)</span> היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\cos\\)</span>, ולא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\sin\\)</span>: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(h'(0)=\\cos\\left(f(0)\\right)\\cdot f'(0)\\)</span>.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "tans2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "(-1)^w*a*b/%pi", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-T", "feedback": "<p>הנגזרת של המכפלה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(x)g(x)\\)</span> היא לא מכפלת הנגזרות. השתמשו בכלל המכפלה: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((fg)'=f'g+fg'\\)</span>.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "b", "dgz", "tans1", "tans2", "w"], "nvariants": 50}